# Dung cho docker-compose.yml o goc du an - dat mat khau SA cho container SQL Server
# (dich vu "db"). docker-compose.yml tu dong ghi de DB_PASSWORD cua service "backend"
# bang chinh gia tri nay khi chay "docker compose up", nen KHONG can sua backend/.env.
#
# SQL Server bat buoc mat khau SA du manh: toi thieu 8 ky tu, co it nhat 3 trong 4 loai
# chu hoa/chu thuong/chu so/ky tu dac biet - vd "123456" se bi container tu choi luc khoi
# dong. Container "db" se bao loi va thoat ngay neu dat mat khau yeu.
#
# Cach dung: copy file nay thanh ".env" (cung thu muc goc, KHONG phai backend/.env),
# dien mat khau du manh vao.
DB_SA_PASSWORD=TestDocker#2026